==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|ru|ди́кий|alt1=ди́к(ий)|-ь}}. Compare {{cog|be|дзіч|t=game; backwoods|g=f}}, {{cog|pl|dzicz|t=wilderness; backwater; mob|g=f}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Lvova-дичь.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|it͡ɕ|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|a||f|a=an|n=sg}}

# [[game]] (wild animals or birds hunted for food)
#: {{syn|ru|дичи́на}}
